-- title:
--   Lemma 2, p. 4 ((16) bracket) — for α > 3, lim [k²‖x_{k+1} − x_k‖²/(2s) + (k+1)²(Θ(x_{k+1}) − Θ(x*))] exists
-- statement:
--   Under the standing assumptions of §1 ($\Psi$ proper, lower semicontinuous and convex with values in $\mathbb R\cup\{+\infty\}$; $\Phi$ real, convex, continuously differentiable with $L$-Lipschitz gradient; $\Theta=\Psi+\Phi$; $0<s<1/L$; $(x_k)$ generated by algorithm (2)), assume $\alpha>3$ and let $x^*$ minimize $\Theta$. With $d_k=\frac1{2s}\|x_{k+1}-x_k\|^2$ and $\theta_k=\Theta(x_k)-\Theta(x^*)$, there is a real number $\ell$ such that
--   $$\lim_{k\to\infty}\Big[k^2d_k+(k+1)^2\theta_{k+1}\Big]=\lim_{k\to\infty}\Big[k^2\frac{\|x_{k+1}-x_k\|^2}{2s}+(k+1)^2\big(\Theta(x_{k+1})-\Theta(x^*)\big)\Big]=\ell .$$
--
--   The authors call this result new and central to the proof of Theorem 1: combined with the summability of $\frac1k[k^2d_k+(k+1)^2\theta_{k+1}]$ (Facts 3 and 4) it forces the limit to be $0$.
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The page's statement of Lemma 2 writes $k^2\|x_{k+1}-x_k\|^2$ in the bracket; its proof, display (16), establishes convergence of $k^2d_k+(k+1)^2\theta_{k+1}$ with $d_k=\|x_{k+1}-x_k\|^2/(2s)$, and that is the form the proof of Theorem 1 combines with Facts 3 and 4. The statement here is the (16) bracket. The printed bracket also converges, but only as a consequence of Theorem 1. The limit is a real number, stated as convergence in the extended reals to the image of some $\ell\in\mathbb R$ (convergence alone would be automatic for monotone sequences in the extended reals).
-- source:
--   Attouch and Peypouquet, The Rate of Convergence of Nesterov's Accelerated Forward-Backward Method is Actually Faster than 1/k^2, arXiv:1510.08740v4, p. 4, Lemma 2 and its proof (16) (bracket with d_k = ||x_{k+1} - x_k||^2/(2s))

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_ThreeOpSplitting_ConvexRates_Problem
import Definitions.Def_NesterovFB_Rates_Algorithm

open Filter Topology InnerProductSpace

namespace NesterovFB.Rates

theorem lemma_2 {H : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup H] [InnerProductSpace ℝ H] [CompleteSpace H]
    (Ψ : H → EReal) (Φ : H → ℝ) (L : NNReal) (s α : ℝ) (P : H → H) (x : ℕ → H)
    (hΨ : ThreeOpSplitting.ConvexRates.IsProperClosedConvex Ψ)
    (hΦc : ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ Φ) (hΦd : ContDiff ℝ 1 Φ)
    (hL : LipschitzWith L (gradient Φ))
    (hs : 0 < s) (hsL : s * L < 1)
    (hP : ThreeOpSplitting.ConvexRates.IsProx s Ψ P)
    (hrun : IsAccelFBRun Φ P α s x)
    (hα : 3 < α)
    (xstar : H) (hxstar : ∀ y, theta Ψ Φ xstar ≤ theta Ψ Φ y) :
    ∃ l : ℝ, Tendsto (fun k : ℕ =>
        (((k : ℝ) ^ 2 * (‖x (k + 1) - x k‖ ^ 2 / (2 * s)) : ℝ) : EReal)
          + ((((k : ℝ) + 1) ^ 2 : ℝ) : EReal) * (theta Ψ Φ (x (k + 1)) - theta Ψ Φ xstar))
      atTop (𝓝 (l : EReal)) := by sorry

end NesterovFB.Rates
